## 8. Evidence Handling and Documentation Findings

All collected files were re-hashed. Every file matches its sums file, with one exception noted below.

| Case | Finding | Required fix |
|---|---|---|
| All | `investigation_notes.md` empty in all four cases | Write analyst notes (this report can be the base) |
| 002, 003, 004 | `chain_of_custody.txt` empty. CASE-001 has one entry (ID `E005-01`, does not match `acquisition.txt`) | Complete custody records |
| 001 to 003 | `DC01-Security.evtx`, `eve.json`, `fast.log` are identical copies in each case and include runs from 06:41 UTC | Keep one shared source and record per-case time windows, or extract per-case subsets |
| 001 | `E001-02` destination says CASE-002 and its description is copied from the evtx entry. `E-001-03` SHA-256 in `acquisition.txt` differs from the file (sums file matches). Evidence ID formats inconsistent (`E001-01`, `E-001-03`) | Correct fields, re-hash, unify ID format |
| 001 | `timaestap-comparsion.csv` first row UTC 07:35:57 should be 07:35:22; field-dictionary lines at the top | Correct row and filename |
| 002 | 4 of 5 acquisition entries show destination CASE-001. `E-002-04 asrep-alerts.json` does not exist (file is `event-4768-alerts.json`). Timestamp CSV mislabels AS-REQ/AS-REP as "AES-REQ/AES-REP" and the first row UTC is 07:35:51 instead of 07:37:51 | Correct destinations and names |
| 003 | `E003-02/03` reference `rule-100204-*.json`, which do not exist (files are `event-4662-*`). `E003-02` destination CASE-002. Timestamp CSV copy-pasted from CASE-002: wrong pcap name, "AS-REP Roasting" notes, Wazuh row has original and UTC swapped | Rebuild the comparison file |
| 004 | `E004-02` acquisition time 2026-10-25 predates the incident; `E004-01` time (05:50 UTC) is earlier than records inside the file (up to 21:15 UTC). Source labelled "DC01" but the host is `WIN-MT4VSSDMUEM`. `lsass.dmp` is not registered as evidence. Description names `C:\lsass.dmp` while Sysmon records `C:\lsass.exe.dmp`. Timestamp CSV UTC column is wrong (wrong dates and offset sign) | Correct times, host label and register the dump |

